            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cook4me"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made a large batch of brown rice and found this recipes upon searching for rice recipes. Really like this; easy to make and taste good. I used unbleached flour instead of wheat. Taste almost like a pancake.",
            "datePublished": "2020-03-30T00:01:06.703Z"
          },
          {
