            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Leslie2881"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this on a whim after trying to figure out what to do with a ton of brown rice I had. They were delicious! I didn't have chives, so I used chopped onion as the other reviewer suggested. I also didn't have nutmeg, so I subbed with 1/8 tsp of chili powder and paprika. They were really, really tasty! My kids ate theirs with a little ketchup and went back for seconds. This one is definitely a keeper.",
            "datePublished": "2012-10-05T09:49:37.027Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
